+STATEMENT: >>>
+This release contains the following enhancements:
+
+1\) Fixed: creating a document in the Web UI is now a recoverable
+operation. If the index rebuild or the HTML/PDF export fails after the
+source file is written, StrictDoc reports the error, rolls the partial
+creation back, and keeps the index consistent with disk. Submitting the
+same form again finishes the same document without a duplicate, and
+existing documents are never overwritten.
